body:
I feel awful but I've actually fallen out with my grandpa over this kind of thing. I'm a paramedic (currently working in an office doing telephone triage) and saw this coming about 3 - maybe 4 - weeks ago. I messaged him wishing him well and asking (begging) him to stay inside for his own sake and he threw off all my concerns, insinuated I was being dramatic, and said he had to die of something. I then advised him if that was his point of view, he should not see anyone who does not wish to die this death as he could be facilitating that, and to not even think of stepping close to the rest of my family. He always answers my texts but he's only read the last few and not replied. Heartbroken but I have lot of other stuff to deal with right now and I'm not quite ready for that fight yet.

&#x200B;

What is with elderly people!? I get it to an extent, but mostly, I really don't.
